   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sorry, you won&#39;t be able to use mysql on spark. It&#39;s not feasible for us to support spark as a mysql server, and it would be a bad idea to allow your mysql server to accept connections from a remote machine like spark.<div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>If you want to use sqlite, you should be able to install the R package RSQLite on spark. I&#39;ve also installed the sqlite and sqlite3 packages so you can access it from the command shell.</div><div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>-Winston</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
